    "detailed_description": "<strong>Mauled</strong> is a <strong>Free-To-Play</strong>, Third-Person Shooter with online <strong>CO-OP</strong> gameplay. Battle through a variety of maps against <strong>endless hordes</strong> of ferocious creatures. Arm yourself with <strong>multiple weapons</strong> available for purchase in <strong>citadels</strong> between rounds.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1599410/extras/f2b3529451c4198243f5dda25b295f89.avif?t=1697983452\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Survive <strong>waves of monsters</strong> spawning from portals.<br></li><li><strong>Multiplayer Co-op:</strong> Team up with friends for a cooperative gameplay experience.<br></li><li>Acquire player <strong>enhancements</strong> at citadels between rounds.<br></li><li>Rest and resupply in citadels with <strong>weapon upgrades</strong> and health regeneration.<br></li><li><strong>Four classes of weapons</strong>: common, rare, epic, and legendary.<br></li><li><strong>Use traps</strong> to exterminate the hordes.<br></li><li>Periodic <strong>boss fights</strong> to up the ante.</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1599410/extras/2f6e578a702773e599ab35f81c4f2166.avif?t=1697983452\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">About Elements Studio:</h2>I developed this game <strong>single-handedly</strong> and I'm passionate about delivering a fun experience. While I may be a one-man team, I'm committed to improving and updating the game based on your feedback. For direct suggestions, join our <strong>Discord channel</strong>.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Support My Work:</h2>If you enjoy the game and want to support its ongoing development, consider leaving a positive review. Your feedback will help in the creation of new assets, plugins, and technologies to improve the game.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Join the Community:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Discord: <br></li><li>Youtube: </li></ul><br>Download Mauled now and dive into the action!",
